  aciklama:
  - "Ayr\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n erkek ve ayr\u0131l\u0131k sonras\u0131 hislerin,
    e\u011Fitim hayat\u0131n\u0131 negatif etkilemeye ramak kala, te\u011Fet ge\xE7iyor
    gibi g\xF6z\xFCk\xFCyor {{isimcigim}}. Bu y\xF6nden \u015Fansl\u0131s\u0131n.
    Fakat belki de hem e\u011Fitiminde, hem de a\u015Fkta ayn\u0131 anda kazan\u0131rs\u0131n,
    kim bilir?... Gel fal\u0131n\u0131n merkezindeki yans\u0131malarla devam edelim;"
